<title>FINLAND: Nokia Q1 net sales by business group.</title>
<headline>Nokia Q1 net sales by business group.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish telecoms group Nokia Oy on Tuesday gave the following breakdown by business group of its first-quarter net sales (FIM million):</p>
<p> Net sales		     Q1/97    Q1/96		1996</p>
<p> Telecommunications	  3,734    2,777	    13,333</p>
<p> Mobile Phones		 6,151    3,889	    21,579</p>
<p> Other operations	    1,632    1,498	     5,197</p>
<p> Intra-group eliminations   -186     -233		-788</p>
<p> TOTAL			  11,331    7,931	    39,321</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, e-mail news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
